#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/0-index.md:20
#: ca37e0f8ec8b458f93446c870097ac56
msgid ""
"For VR teleoperation, **Pico** and **Meta Quest** are the primary tested "
"headsets. Both can use **WebXR** (`./run.sh vr`) and **XRoboToolkit** "
"(`./run.sh vr-xrt`). **Pico Enterprise** is the preferred Pico SKU: it "
"supports **USB shared networking (USB 网络共享)** and uses a **different "
"headset App** from Pico consumer."
msgstr ""
"VR 遥操作主要验证过 **Pico** 和 **Meta Quest**。二者均可使用 **WebXR**（`./run.sh vr`）和 "
"**XRoboToolkit**（`./run.sh vr-xrt`）。**Pico 企业版** 是首选 Pico SKU：支持 **USB "
"网络共享**，并且使用与 Pico 消费版**不同的头显 App** — 不要把一个 App 当成同时覆盖两个版本。"

