#: 106e6405454344b4a6196bbc37bd8170
msgid "Headset + VR controllers (Pico Enterprise / consumer, Meta Quest)"
msgstr "头显 + VR 手柄（Pico Enterprise / 消费版、Meta Quest）"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/0-index.md:0
#: e8741034d4dd4939942b94edd1bb14a3
msgid ""
"End-effector pose; triggers for gripper/hand; buttons for FSM and pause. "
"The current `./run.sh vr` path starts controller mode; this docs set does "
"not document a launch entry for VR gesture / hand-tracking recognition."
msgstr ""
"末端位姿；扳机关夹爪或手；按键处理 FSM 和暂停。当前的 `./run.sh vr` 路径启动的是头显手柄模式；本页文档没有给出打开 VR "
"手势或手部追踪识别的启动入口。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/0-index.md:0
#: ad3439c70f004679a0549dc62c4f941e
msgid "Game controller"
msgstr "游戏手柄"

