msgstr "SteamVR Vive Tracker（`vive_tracker_teleop`）"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/0-index.md:0
#: 8ff9565e04304cf68863a770ab2df65b
msgid ""
"Arm end-effector pose. Named **Vive Tracker** in the package and in these "
"docs, not “Valve Tracker”."
msgstr "手臂末端位姿。软件包和本文档中的名称是 **Vive Tracker**，而不是 “Valve Tracker”。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/0-index.md:0
#: 2b1c0b84019b4e54b247e25908a8a2a8
msgid "Foot pedal"
msgstr "脚踏板"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/0-index.md:0
#: e36fd37bb52744bda67f0715909d13a3
msgid "USB pedal (`arms_teleop`, SayoDevice CM6K)"
msgstr "USB 脚踏板（`arms_teleop`，SayoDevice CM6K）"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/0-index.md:0
#: bfe58a54f8f44dfd8fa696f19931f485
msgid ""
"Assist only: events on `/teleop/controller_state`. Not a complete teleop "
"setup."
msgstr "仅作辅助：在 `/teleop/controller_state` 上发布事件。不是完整的遥操作方案。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/0-index.md:41
#: af105193dfc04342bc3ec15460c45a15
msgid ""
"Pose-based VR, Wuji, and Vive Tracker paths publish to these end-effector "
"topics. Joystick teleop uses `control_input`, twist, `/cmd_vel`, and "
"`/fsm_command` instead. The foot pedal publishes "
"`/teleop/controller_state` only."
msgstr ""
"基于位姿的 VR、Wuji 和 Vive Tracker 路径会发布到这些末端话题。手柄遥操作改用 "
"`control_input`、twist、`/cmd_vel` 和 `/fsm_command`。脚踏板只发布 "
"`/teleop/controller_state`。"

